{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"a1-grammar-nominativ-akkusativ","level":"A1","topic":"Kasus","title":{"de":"Nominativ und Akkusativ","bn":"Nominativ ও Akkusativ"},"summary":"কে কাজ করছে (Nominativ) আর কাকে/কী-কে নিয়ে (Akkusativ); der → den।","intro":[{"kind":"text","text":"Bro, এই Topic-টা প্রথমে একটু কঠিন মনে হতে পারে। কিন্তু একটি সহজ প্রশ্ন মনে রাখলে বুঝতে পারবে।"},{"kind":"list","items":["Nominativ = কে কাজ করছে?","Akkusativ = কাকে বা কী-কে নিয়ে কাজ হচ্ছে?"]}],"sections":[{"heading":"১. একটি গল্প দিয়ে বুঝি","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"ধরো, একজন ছেলে একটি কুকুরকে দেখছে।"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Der Junge sieht den Hund.","en":"The boy sees the dog.","bn":"ছেলেটি কুকুরটিকে দেখে।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"এখানে:"},{"kind":"list","items":["Der Junge = ছেলেটি দেখছে। তাই Nominativ।","den Hund = যাকে দেখছে। তাই Akkusativ।"]},{"kind":"table","rows":[["অংশ","ভূমিকা","বাংলা"],["Der Junge","Nominativ: কে দেখছে?","ছেলেটি"],["sieht","Verb","দেখে"],["den Hund","Akkusativ: কাকে দেখছে?","কুকুরটিকে"]]}]},{"heading":"২. Article কীভাবে পরিবর্তন হয়?","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"এটাই এই Topic-এর সবচেয়ে গুরুত্বপূর্ণ অংশ।"},{"kind":"table","rows":[["Gender","Nominativ","Akkusativ"],["Masculine","der Mann","den Mann"],["Feminine","die Frau","die Frau"],["Neuter","das Kind","das Kind"],["Plural","die Kinder","die Kinder"]]},{"kind":"text","text":"দেখো, Akkusativ-এ masculine der → den হয়। এই পরিবর্তনটি বিশেষভাবে মনে রাখবে।"}]},{"heading":"৩. ein ও einen-এর নিয়ম","blocks":[{"kind":"table","rows":[["Gender","Nominativ","Akkusativ"],["Masculine","ein Mann","einen Mann"],["Feminine","eine Frau","eine Frau"],["Neuter","ein Kind","ein Kind"]]},{"kind":"text","text":"উদাহরণ:"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich sehe einen Mann.","en":"I see a man.","bn":"আমি একজন পুরুষকে দেখি।"},{"de":"Ich kaufe eine Tasche.","en":"I buy a bag.","bn":"আমি একটি ব্যাগ কিনি।"},{"de":"Er liest ein Buch.","en":"He reads a book.","bn":"সে একটি বই পড়ে।"}]}]},{"heading":"৪. কীভাবে নিজে বুঝবে?","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"যেকোনো বাক্যে প্রথমে প্রশ্ন করো:"},{"kind":"list","items":["কে কাজটি করছে? → Nominativ","কাকে বা কী-কে নিয়ে কাজটি হচ্ছে? → Akkusativ"],"numbered":true},{"kind":"text","text":"উদাহরণ:"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich kaufe einen Apfel.","bn":"আমি একটি আপেল কিনি।"}]},{"kind":"list","items":["কে কিনছে? → Ich (আমি) = Nominativ।","কী কিনছি? → einen Apfel (একটি আপেল) = Akkusativ।"]},{"kind":"text","text":"মনে রাখবে, প্রতিটি বাক্যে Akkusativ object থাকতেই হবে এমন নয়।"}]}],"test":[{"id":"a1-grammar-nominativ-akkusativ-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich sehe ___ Mann.","options":["der","den","dem"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Mann masculine, আর তাকে দেখছি (Akkusativ), তাই der → den।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-nominativ-akkusativ-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Der Junge sieht den Hund.“ বাক্যে Nominativ কোনটি?","options":["Der Junge","den Hund","sieht"],"answer":0,"explanation":"কে দেখছে? ছেলেটি। তাই Der Junge হলো Nominativ।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-nominativ-akkusativ-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich kaufe ___ Apfel. (der Apfel)","options":["ein","eine","einen"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Apfel masculine, Akkusativ-এ ein → einen।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-nominativ-akkusativ-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich kaufe ___ Tasche. (die Tasche)","options":["einen","eine","ein"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Feminine-এ Akkusativ-এও eine থাকে।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-nominativ-akkusativ-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Akkusativ-এ কোন article বদলায়?","options":["শুধু masculine (der → den)","শুধু feminine (die → den)","সবগুলোই বদলায়"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Akkusativ-এ শুধু masculine বদলায়: der → den, ein → einen।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-nominativ-akkusativ-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"Akkusativ কোন প্রশ্নের উত্তর দেয়?","options":["কে কাজ করছে?","কখন কাজ হচ্ছে?","কাকে বা কী-কে নিয়ে কাজ হচ্ছে?"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Akkusativ = কাকে বা কী-কে নিয়ে কাজ হচ্ছে।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-nominativ-akkusativ-t7","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Er liest ein Buch.“ বাক্যে Akkusativ কোনটি?","options":["ein Buch","Er","liest"],"answer":0,"explanation":"কী পড়ছে? একটি বই। তাই ein Buch হলো Akkusativ।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-nominativ-akkusativ-t8","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich sehe ___ Kind. (das Kind)","options":["den","das","dem"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Neuter Akkusativ-এ বদলায় না: das Kind।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"a1-grammar-nominativ-akkusativ","level":"A1","test":[{"id":"a1-grammar-nominativ-akkusativ-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich sehe ___ Mann.","options":["der","den","dem"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Mann masculine, আর তাকে দেখছি (Akkusativ), তাই der → den।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-nominativ-akkusativ-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Der Junge sieht den Hund.“ বাক্যে Nominativ কোনটি?","options":["Der Junge","den Hund","sieht"],"answer":0,"explanation":"কে দেখছে? ছেলেটি। তাই Der Junge হলো Nominativ।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-nominativ-akkusativ-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich kaufe ___ Apfel. (der Apfel)","options":["ein","eine","einen"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Apfel masculine, Akkusativ-এ ein → einen।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-nominativ-akkusativ-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich kaufe ___ Tasche. (die Tasche)","options":["einen","eine","ein"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Feminine-এ Akkusativ-এও eine থাকে।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-nominativ-akkusativ-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Akkusativ-এ কোন article বদলায়?","options":["শুধু masculine (der → den)","শুধু feminine (die → den)","সবগুলোই বদলায়"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Akkusativ-এ শুধু masculine বদলায়: der → den, ein → einen।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-nominativ-akkusativ-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"Akkusativ কোন প্রশ্নের উত্তর দেয়?","options":["কে কাজ করছে?","কখন কাজ হচ্ছে?","কাকে বা কী-কে নিয়ে কাজ হচ্ছে?"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Akkusativ = কাকে বা কী-কে নিয়ে কাজ হচ্ছে।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-nominativ-akkusativ-t7","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Er liest ein Buch.“ বাক্যে Akkusativ কোনটি?","options":["ein Buch","Er","liest"],"answer":0,"explanation":"কী পড়ছে? একটি বই। তাই ein Buch হলো Akkusativ।"},{"id":"a1-grammar-nominativ-akkusativ-t8","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich sehe ___ Kind. (das Kind)","options":["den","das","dem"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Neuter Akkusativ-এ বদলায় না: das Kind।"}]}